<h2 class="project-title">Foliage of War</h2>

<p>Foliage of War is a procedural tower defense where you
 and your army of plants try to defend the last green tree
 from the herbivore invaders. We were given 2 weeks to
 create this game with the theme of <em>“Branching Out.”</em></p>

